    "chunk_text": "untas & beorgas drihten Benedicite montes et colles domino. Bletsia\u00f0 ealle growendra on eor\u00f0an drihten benedicite uniuersa germinentia in terra domino. Bletsia\u00f0 wyllas drihten benedicite fontes domino. Bletsia\u00f0 s\u00e6as & flodas drihten Benedicite maria et flumina domino. Bletsia\u00f0 hw\u00e6las & ealle \u00fea \u00fee beo\u00f0 gestyred on w\u00e6teru drihten Benedicite coete et omnia que Bletsia\u00f0 ealle fugelas heofenes drihten benedicite omnes uolucres c\u00ebli domino. Bletsia\u00f0 ealle wildeor & nytenu drihten Benedicite omnes besti\u00eb et pecora domino. Bletsia\u00f0 manna drihten benedicite filii hominum domino. Bletsia\u00f0 israhel drihten heria\u00f0 & oferblissig hine on Benedicat israhel dominum laudet et Bletsia\u00f0 preostas drihten drihten Benedicite sacerdotes domini domino. Bletsia\u00f0 \u00feeowas drihten drihten benedicite serui domini domino. Bletsia\u00f0 gast & sawla rihtwisra drihten Benedicite spiritus et anime iustorun domino. Halig & eadmode heortan drihten benedicite sancti et humiles corde domino. Bletsia\u00f0 sidrac misaoc abdenago drihten heria\u00f0 & oferblisia\u00f0 hine on worulde uton bletsian f\u00e6der Gebletsod drihten god for\u00feon on heanesse & dyde alysednesse folce Benedictus dominus deus & ar\u00e6rde horn h\u00e6le us on huse cnihtes his Et erexit cornu salutis nobis in domo dauid pueri sui. Swaswa he spr\u00e6c is \u00feurh mu\u00f0 haligra for\u00feon witegena his Sicut locutus est per os sanctorum qui a H\u00e6l of fe",
